<h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p class="text-muted">Last updated: 28 November 2026</p>
<h4>Information collected</h4><p>We store account details, patient-profile information, appointments, notifications, and clinical records required to provide clinic services.</p>
<h4>How information is used</h4><p>Information is used for scheduling, treatment, clinic administration, security, and communication about care.</p>
<h4>Access</h4><p>Patients, doctors, and administrators receive different access according to their role and relationship to the record.</p>
<h4>Retention and security</h4><p>Clinical information is retained for continuity of care. Reasonable technical and organizational safeguards are applied.</p>
<h4>Your choices</h4><p>Users may review and correct profile information and contact the clinic about privacy requests.</p>
